BoleMusic NS
Modified by shellsec and contributors, 2026.

This Nintendo Switch adaptation is based on the LX Music custom-source protocol
and adaptations of the associated implementation from:
  LX Music Desktop, by lyswhut and contributors
  https://github.com/lyswhut/lx-music-desktop
The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained verbatim in LICENSE.
Original copyright notices in retained upstream files remain in place.
This is an unofficial derivative/adaptation, not an endorsed upstream release.

Changes dated 2026-10-21:
- Removed all bundled source scripts, presets, recommended endpoints and links.
- Fresh installs load no sources; only explicit user imports are registered.
- Added opt-in multi-source failover, persisted user order, and saved subscriptions
  with an empty default URL. Exhausted playback may check the user subscription
  once, with a ten-minute cooldown and one extra retry round only on changes.
- Added script-free RomFS staging and release regression checks.
- Replaced source-specific documentation and removed legacy promotional material.

